  "source_changes": [
    "Bind the actual live calling TID's PIDFD_THREAD and an already-open read-only proc stat before clone; verify procfs and the same TID.",
    "Pin source descriptors above 5 before remapping to control FD3, creator PIDFD FD4, and creator stat FD5; raw children use bounded direct pread64 with no pathname reopen.",
    "After initial PDEATHSIG arming and credential rearming, reject dead/exiting creators using both the PIDFD and same held stat. The stat check covers the real thread-group-leader PIDFD polling delay.",
    "Retain FD5 through MAPPED and CLONE_PARENT; nested PID1 repeats the held-thread checks after arming, then closes FD4/5 before mount/READY. The keeper closes FD4/5 after descriptor handoff.",
    "Keep all frozen r5 device implementation and tree source bytes; the product patch changes only child.rs and its focused tests.",
    "Retain explicit private test-only fault barriers. Compiled nested leader control exists but was not invoked."
  ],
